notes: This is the BD-Difco/Bacto yeast nitrogen base family without amino acids,
  before separate glucose, amino-acid or agar supplementation. NBRC114 and NBRC111
  each explicitly name Bacto-Yeast Nitrogen Base w/o Amino acids (Difco),6.7g, but
  their receiving amino-acid supplements differ. NBRC1402 prints Bactp-Yeast Nitrogen
  Base w/o Amino Acids,6.7g, with glucose/water/agar only; Bactp is interpreted as
  a typographical brand variant by the otherwise matching product name, exclusion
  qualifier and dose, without assigning an unstated historical SKU. The current official
  BD291940 title corroborates the without-amino-acids product family, but neither
  its catalogue number nor a particular historical manufacturing lot is assigned to
  these source recipes. This family excludes complete YNB and the distinct formulation
  lacking both amino acids and ammonium sulfate. No full chemical composition, invariant
  lot, whole receiving medium or role is asserted. Raw source labels Bactp-Yeast Nitrogen
  Base w/o Amino Acids and Bacto-Yeast Nitrogen Base w/o Amino acids (Difco) remain
  occurrence provenance, not global resolving synonyms.
